WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.996
Build a small app you can click.

00:00:02.996 --> 00:00:06.420
Then understand the agent behind its AI button.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:12.411
We will inspect real tools, a server side safety stop, and independently matched
traces.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:15.407
The introduction is illustrative, never telemetry proof.

00:00:15.407 --> 00:00:17.119
All incidents are synthetic.

00:00:17.119 --> 00:00:23.111
Keep account names, tenant details, private addresses and credentials out of every
shared frame.

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:30.000
Your turn: follow the manual task. Pause for more time.
